* ==============================================================================
* LepiLED Rev 4.0 (Option 2) — Verified Semiconductor & Protection SPICE Models
* Grounded in local PDFs in datasheets/
* ==============================================================================

* --- Luminus SST-10-UV-A130-G365-00 (365 nm UV-A) ---
* Vf = 3.59 V typ @ 333 mA (3.60 V @ 350 mA), Rdyn = 0.75 Ohm
.model D_SST10_UV D(IS=1.2e-18 N=3.45 RS=0.75 CJO=120p BV=5.0 IBV=1m)

* --- Cree XP-E2 Visible LEDs (BV=1.0 V honors Cree VR_max = 1.0 V rating!) ---
* Royal Blue (455 nm): Vf = 2.92 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_RB  D(IS=3.5e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)
* Green (528 nm): Vf = 2.69 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_GRN D(IS=2.8e-15 N=3.15 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)
* Cool White (6200 K): Vf = 2.92 V @ 333 mA (25 C), Rdyn = 0.45 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_CW  D(IS=3.5e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.45 CJO=90p BV=1.0 IBV=100u)

* --- Diodes Inc. B340A-13-F (40 V 3 A SMA Schottky) ---
* Vf ~ 0.34 V @ 0.33 A, 0.38 V @ 1.0 A
.model D_B340A D(IS=1.5e-5 N=1.18 RS=0.045 CJO=250p VJ=0.35 M=0.45 BV=40 IBV=500u)

* --- Diodes Inc. BAT54-7-F (30 V 200 mA SOT-23 Schottky) ---
* Vf <= 240 mV @ 0.1 mA (~200 mV @ 51 uA)
.model D_BAT54 D(IS=1.2e-7 N=1.04 RS=1.5 CJO=10p BV=30 IBV=2u)

* --- Diodes Inc. BZT52C5V1-7-F (5.1 V 500 mW Zener) ---
.model D_BZT52C5V1 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0 RS=1.0 BV=5.10 IBV=5m CJO=150p)

* --- Green 0603 Indicator LED (LTST-C190GKT, Vf ~ 2.1 V @ 3 mA) ---
.model D_LED_GRN_IND D(IS=1e-18 N=2.2 RS=5.0 CJO=15p BV=5.0)

* --- Vishay SMBJ22CA Bidirectional 22 V TVS (Vbr = 24.4-26.9 V, Vc = 35.5 V @ 16.9 A) ---
.subckt TVS_SMBJ22CA p1 p2
* Back-to-back avalanche clamps with dynamic impedance R_dyn ~ 0.55 Ohm
Dpos mid p1 D_TVS22
Dneg mid p2 D_TVS22
Ctvs p1 p2 650p
.model D_TVS22 D(IS=1e-12 N=1.2 RS=0.28 BV=24.8 IBV=1m)
.ends TVS_SMBJ22CA

* --- Diodes Inc. DMN3404L-7 (30 V N-MOSFET, Vth=1.5 V, Rds=42 mOhm @ 4.5 V / 63 mOhm @ 3.0 V) ---
.model DMN3404L NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.45 KP=22.0 RD=0.015 RS=0.015 CBD=120p CBS=150p CGSO=180p CGDO=60p LAMBDA=0.01)

* --- onsemi BSS138 (50 V N-MOSFET, Vth=1.1 V, Rds<=6 Ohm @ 4.5 V) ---
.model BSS138_MOD NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.15 KP=0.25 RD=0.8 RS=0.8 CBD=15p CBS=20p CGSO=25p CGDO=8p LAMBDA=0.01)

* --- TI LM4040BIM3-2.5/NOPB (2.500 V +/-0.2% Shunt Voltage Reference, Ir_min=65 uA) ---
.subckt LM4040_2V5 K A
* Smooth behavioral shunt clamping K-A at 2.500 V for I >= 60 uA, Z_dyn = 0.5 Ohm
Dref A K D_LM4040
Rleak K A 10Meg
Cref K A 10p
.model D_LM4040 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0 RS=0.50 BV=2.500 IBV=60u)
.ends LM4040_2V5

* --- TI LM393BIDR Open-Collector Comparator Channel ---
* Pulls OUT to GND (< 20 mV @ 100 uA) when IN+ < IN-; high-Z when IN+ > IN-
.subckt LM393B_CH INP INM OUT VCC GND
Rin INP INM 2Meg
* Supply quiescent current (~0.3 mA per channel)
Rq VCC GND 65k
* Smooth open-collector pull-down switch: ON when V(INP)-V(INM) < 0 (active even down to VCC=2V)
B_drv drv GND V = { (V(VCC,GND) > 1.8) ? (0.5*(1 - tanh((V(INP,INM))/0.002))) : 0 }
S_oc OUT GND drv GND SW_LM393
R_leak OUT GND 100Meg
.model SW_LM393 SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.05 RON=25 ROFF=100Meg)
.ends LM393B_CH
